1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,784
An invoice says one price. A contract says another. Which agreement applied, and can a second reviewer reproduce the

2
00:00:08,784 --> 00:00:17,105
decision? Prooflane gives accounts payable and procurement teams a review record that connects the price difference to its

3
00:00:17,105 --> 00:00:22,190
sources. This edited walkthrough uses fictional data and real browser captures.

4
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:30,955
The case starts with invoice and contract CSVs. Prooflane matches the supplier, item, and effective date. Seven of eight

5
00:00:30,955 --> 00:00:39,719
invoices enter this calculation. One has no active supplied contract and is excluded with a reason. Its billed amount

6
00:00:39,719 --> 00:00:43,871
remains visible; exclusion never turns it into estimated savings.

7
00:00:43,871 --> 00:00:52,480
Invoice five hundred and four has two overlapping contract versions. The interface shows the consequence of each eligible

8
00:00:52,480 --> 00:01:01,568
price: forty dollars or thirty two dollars. The reviewer explicitly selected C two R. That decision remains attached to

9
00:01:01,568 --> 00:01:06,351
the frozen baseline, instead of disappearing into a spreadsheet formula.

10
00:01:06,351 --> 00:01:15,622
This is the saved successful AI run from November ninth, not a new model call during this recording. Vultr Serverless

11
00:01:15,622 --> 00:01:23,040
Inference generated Python, and a disposable Docker container executed it. An independent Decimal verifier checked every

12
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:30,921
finding. The result is seven hundred and sixty eight dollars of positive price variance, not recovered cash.

13
00:01:30,921 --> 00:01:39,822
The proof chapter exposes the actual returned model and both Vultr request identifiers. After verification, the model

14
00:01:39,822 --> 00:01:49,770
selected the focus of the review guidance. The server inserted the checked amounts. Generated code runs with no network,

15
00:01:49,770 --> 00:01:57,101
no host mounts, no injected credentials, and strict resource limits. Docker unavailability causes refusal.

16
00:01:57,101 --> 00:02:05,339
Prooflane also calculates when a review priority would change. One shared contract price affects three invoices together.

17
00:02:05,339 --> 00:02:15,516
At eighty two dollars and fifty nine cents, invoice five hundred and one remains first. One cent higher produces a tie;

18
00:02:15,516 --> 00:02:22,301
the next cent changes the leader. These are explicit arithmetic assumptions, not AI predictions.

19
00:02:22,301 --> 00:02:31,499
Here is the containment moment. These fixed probes were freshly run from the public site on the existing Vultr virtual

20
00:02:31,499 --> 00:02:39,317
machine. Network access failed, a root filesystem write was denied, the inference credential variable was absent, the

21
00:02:39,317 --> 00:02:45,756
effective user was non root, and container removal was confirmed. Five observed checks passed.

22
00:02:45,756 --> 00:02:54,908
A reviewer can download the source linked JSON packet and check it again. The original AI packet passed all seven

23
00:02:54,908 --> 00:03:02,687
verification groups in the browser and in the offline command line verifier. These checks reconstruct source choices,

24
00:03:02,687 --> 00:03:10,923
arithmetic, hashes, and priority boundaries. They do not authenticate the supplier or prove that a supplied contract is

25
00:03:10,923 --> 00:03:11,381
true.

26
00:03:11,381 --> 00:03:19,162
The initial audience is accounts payable teams that already export invoice and contract tables. A team subscription for

27
00:03:19,162 --> 00:03:26,510
recurring exception reviews is a business hypothesis. We have not measured customer savings or adoption. Our next

28
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:34,723
validation compares how quickly a second reviewer can reproduce the same dispute with a spreadsheet and with a Prooflane

29
00:03:34,723 --> 00:03:35,155
packet.

30
00:03:35,155 --> 00:03:44,640
Try the public demo, inspect the open source repository, and verify the included fictional case yourself. Prooflane

31
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:53,008
connects source decisions, contained AI execution, and portable arithmetic evidence. Our four person team participated

32
00:03:53,008 --> 00:03:57,471
online. The prototype is available now on Vultr.
